WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.365 --> 00:00:03.917
(cheerful music)

00:00:03.917 --> 00:00:06.557
- [Narrator] Blimps,
slower than an airplane,

00:00:06.557 --> 00:00:10.469
not very maneuverable, and
a bit on the bulky side,

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:13.371
a relic of the past, right?

00:00:13.371 --> 00:00:15.288
Well, not for everyone.

00:00:22.046 --> 00:00:24.072
- [Narrator] That's right, blimps.

00:00:24.072 --> 00:00:25.517
And Igor has been chasing this very

00:00:25.517 --> 00:00:28.100
specific dream for a long time. 

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:45.295
- [Narrator] Igor studied
engineering in university,

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:47.486
but starting a blimp
empire in the final throws

00:00:47.486 --> 00:00:50.736
of the Soviet Union proved challenging.

00:01:14.137 --> 00:01:16.589
- [Narrator] And Igor's
blimp empire grew from there.

00:01:16.589 --> 00:01:18.316
Eventually selling surveillance blimps

00:01:18.316 --> 00:01:20.582
to governments around the world.

00:01:20.582 --> 00:01:22.659
And to be clear, these
state-of-the-art airships

00:01:22.659 --> 00:01:26.826
are nothing like the blimps
from the Hindenburg days.

00:01:30.104 --> 00:01:31.274
- [Narrator] But in the back of his mind,

00:01:31.274 --> 00:01:32.849
there was another goal:

00:01:32.849 --> 00:01:36.201
to create something the
world has never seen before,

00:01:36.201 --> 00:01:37.534
a cargo airship.

00:01:43.615 --> 00:01:46.054
- [Narrator] That's three
football fields long, just to

00:01:46.054 --> 00:01:48.984
put it in perspective, and
Igor believes a massive-loading

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:52.198
cargo ship could come in
very handy in a catastrophe.

00:01:52.198 --> 00:01:55.781
As seen here in his
own artistic rendering.

00:02:11.703 --> 00:02:12.871
- [Narrator] And he says
he's getting really close

00:02:12.871 --> 00:02:14.614
to realizing that dream.

00:02:14.614 --> 00:02:18.781
But even when his airship takes
to the sky, Igor won't stop.

00:02:27.126 --> 00:02:30.209
(lighthearted music)

